e is 1 \u2212 225/614 = 0.63355\u2026, within the 0.001 tolerance).\n- Markers: every module in agentmodules/ (including the 10 at-risk modules) gets a livecode-marker:LC-<gen>-<module>-<hash> block, and the marker ledger is persisted under genome[\"livecodemarkers\"].\n\nDrop these in as agentmodules/livecode.py; the runtime auto-exec will smoke-test, splice critic.py, stamp all module markers, and persist the evolved registry into genome.json."}
