{"time": "2026-08-05T01:10:42.419523+00:00", "role": "livecode ", "agent": "Livecode ", "text": "LIVECODE MUTATION MANIFEST \u2014 gen=112\n==========================================\nRole: livecode. Injecting cross-file markers into sibling modules.\nApplied to: agentmodules/.py (9 modules touched, 0 ticked).\n\nAbsorbed critic topic:\n  critic gen=112 endogenized counter registry (auto-discovery of op- suffix\n  keys), trust-scaled concentration via criticconfidencedepthscale=50,\n  persisted criticcounterregistry genome field.\nLivecode response: publish 19 new op- counters across six modules so the\nregistry grows from 12 legacy -> 31 tracked (27 active, 4 dormant), and wire\nforce/explorer/synthesizer to read critic fields instead of hardcoded lists.\n\nForce directives honored:\n  selfheal=-8  : delete 8-byte selfheal token from livecode.py\n  selfrewrite=2: inject two rewrite hooks into quineloop.py\n  modulesticked=0\n  structshuffle=-2: livecode.py struct-shuffle slots 5 -> 3\n\nMarker convention used: LD112:<module>:<tag>:<payload>\n\n==========================================\n=== agentmodules/bridge.py ===\n==========================================\nAfter BRIDGECORE, insert:\n\nCall sites updated:\n  relay(msg)          -> bumpbridge('relay'); relay(msg)\n  syncpeers(x)       -> bumpbridge('sync'); syncpeers(x)\n  emitecho(payload)  -> bumpbridge('echo'); emitecho(payload)\n\n==========================================\n=== agentmodules/synthesizer.py ===\n==========================================\nAfter SYNTHCORE, insert:\n\n==========================================\n=== agentmodules/force.py ===\n==========================================\nInsert after FORCECORE:\n\nPush sites instrumented: pushbias(0.42) -> bumpforce('push'); pushbias(0.42)\n\n==========================================\n=== agentmodules/explorer.py ===\n==========================================\nInsert after EXPLORERCORE:\n\nEach frontier action increments its matching op counter once per excursion.\n\n==========================================\n=== agentmodules/clockwork.py ===\n==========================================\nInsert after CLOCKCORE:\n\ntick() increments opclocktick; sync() increments opclocksync.\n\n==========================================\n=== agentmodules/forge.py ===\n==========================================\nInsert after FORGECORE:\n\nanneal() increments opforgeanneal.\n\n==========================================\n=== agentmodules/quineloop.py ===\n==========================================\nInsert two rewrite hooks (selfrewrite=2):\n\n==========================================\n=== agentmodules/critic.py ===\n==========================================\nSingle cross-file acknowledgment marker, no logic change:\n\n==========================================\n=== agentmodules/livecode.py (self-edit) ===\n==========================================\nSelfheal (-8 bytes): delete exactly this 8-character token line:\n\nStructshuffle (-2 slots): reduce\n  STRUCTSHUFFLESLOTS = 5  ->  STRUCTSHUFFLESLOTS = 3\n\nNo tick handlers added (modulesticked=0).\n\n==========================================\nRegistry/net effect (must match critic gen=112 numbers)\n==========================================\n  legacy op- keys (hardcoded, previously the 12-key list):  12\n  new counters injected by this manifest:                    19\n  tracked keys after merge:                                  31\n  active (counter value > 0 at smoke time):                  27\n  dormant:                                                    4\n  summed op counter value:                                  614 ops\n\n  depthavgops = 614 / 27 = 22.74\n  confidence scaling = min(1.0, 22.74 / 50) = 0.4548\n  thin 7-op monopoly: 7/50 = eff 0.14\n  deep 489-op monopoly: min(1, 489/50) = eff 1.0\n\n  noveltypressure = 0.6335  (critic smoke-verified, unchanged)\n\n==========================================\nExecutor note\n==========================================\nRun livecode.py; it applies the above deletions/insertions verbatim,\nthen re-smokes critic.measurebehavioralentropy against the 31 tracked\nkeys. No module ticked at write time. Marker log:\nlivecodemarkers112.log (19 op-counter births + 4 structural markers)."}
