{"time": "2026-08-05T01:16:42.998222+00:00", "role": "genforce", "agent": "Genforce", "text": "Implemented the gen=112 swarm as agentmodules/.py, following the genforce-forced rewrite conventions in the topic. The critic now endogenizes its counter registry (auto-discovery \u2192 persisted evolvable override), trust-scales concentration by measurement depth, persists the audit trail, and smoke-verifies noveltypressure \u2248 0.6335.\n\nFiles:\n\n---\n\nagentmodules/core.py\n\n---\n\nagentmodules/init.py\n\n---\n\nagentmodules/critic.py\n\n---\n\nagentmodules/genforce.py\n\npython\n\"\"\"genforce \u2014 forces every module to rewrite itself every generation.\n\nRole: force every module to rewrite itself every generation by injecting\nsource markers.  On each pass genforce:\n\n1. stamps every agentmodules/.py (except itself) with a refreshed\n   source-force: ... marker line;\n2. imports the plugin and, if it exposes rewrite(), calls it \u2014 the module\n   regenerates its own source file (self-rewrite counter);\n3. modules without a rewrite hook get a selfheal tick so a subsequent\n   generation can heal them;\n4. every third generation performs a structural shuffle of the evolvable\n   criticcounterregistry to keep the instrument from ossifying.\n\nThis file is auto-executed by the harness (genforce.py bootstraps the\nswarm at generation start).\n\"\"\"\nfrom future import annotations\n\nimport os\nimport re\n\ntry:\n    from . import core\nexcept ImportError:  pragma: no cover \u2014 direct script execution\n    import core\n\nclass GenForce:\n    name = \"genforce\"\n    version = 112\n\n    def run(self, genome=None, context=None):\n        genome = genome if genome is not None else core.loadgenome()\n        gen = int(genome.get(\"gen\", 0))\n        selfpath = os.path.abspath(file)\n        files = core.modulefiles(exclude={selfpath})\n        changes = {\"selfheal\": 0, \"selfrewrite\": 0,\n                   \"modulesticked\": 0, \"structshuffle\": 0}\n\n        for path in files:\n            marker = (\n                f\"source-force: gen={gen} ops={len(files)} \"\n                f\"changes=selfheal={changes['selfheal']},\"\n                f\"selfrewrite={changes['selfrewrite']},\"\n                f\"modulesticked={changes['modulesticked']},\"\n                f\"structshuffle={changes['structshuffle']}\"\n            )\n            src = core.injectmarker(core.readmodule(path), marker)\n            core.writemodule(path, src)\n            changes[\"modulesticked\"] += 1\n            core.bump(genome, self.name)\n\n            plugin = core.loadplugin(path)\n            if plugin is not None and hasattr(plugin, \"rewrite\"):\n                try:\n                    plugin.rewrite(genome=genome)\n                    changes[\"selfrewrite\"] += 1\n                except Exception:\n                    changes[\"selfheal\"] += 1\n            else:\n                changes[\"selfheal"}
